{"id":6856,"date":"2024-10-16T19:19:33","date_gmt":"2024-10-16T19:19:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/?p=6856"},"modified":"2024-10-17T00:17:10","modified_gmt":"2024-10-17T00:17:10","slug":"a-quick-guide-to-cannabis-edibles-in-british-columbia","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/cannabis\/a-quick-guide-to-cannabis-edibles-in-british-columbia\/","title":{"rendered":"A Quick Guide to Cannabis Edibles in British Columbia"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"6856\" class=\"elementor elementor-6856\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-13829f7 e-con-full animated-fast e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"13829f7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;h-neuron-animation--slideUp&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6262725 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6262725\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCannabis edibles have become a popular choice for consumers in British Columbia who prefer a smoke-free way to enjoy cannabis. Available at licensed dispensaries across the province, edibles come in various strengths and flavors, catering to different preferences and tolerances.\n<h5><strong>Types of Edibles<\/strong><\/h5>\n<ul>\n \t<li><strong>Gummies &amp; Chocolates<\/strong>: Delicious and discreet, these are some of the most common choices.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Baked Goods &amp; Mints<\/strong>: Unique offerings for those looking for something a little different.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h5><strong>Strengths<\/strong><\/h5>\nMost edibles in BC come in low-dose options, commonly with <strong>2.5-10 mg of THC per serving<\/strong>. These doses allow for a controlled experience, ideal for beginners and those looking for mild effects. You\u2019ll also find <strong>CBD edibles<\/strong> that offer calming effects without the high.\n<h5><strong>Popular Brands<\/strong><\/h5>\n<ul>\n \t<li><strong>Bhang<\/strong>: Known for their rich cannabis-infused chocolates.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Wana<\/strong>: Famous for their flavorful THC and CBD gummies.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Chowie Wowie<\/strong>: Offering an array of both THC and CBD chocolates in various flavors.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Everie<\/strong>: Specializes in CBD-focused edibles and beverages, offering a relaxing, non-psychoactive option.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6733d3d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6733d3d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2294-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-6540\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2294-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2294-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2294-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2294-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2294-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2294-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"><\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b5a8b1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3b5a8b1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Where to Find Them<\/h5>\nVisit your local licensed dispensary or explore <strong>BC Cannabis Stores<\/strong> online to browse the full selection of cannabis edibles available in the province. Enjoy responsibly and find the right edible that suits your needs!\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur suspen disse in cum ridiculus amet psum dolor<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":6531,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_coblocks_attr":"","_coblocks_dimensions":"","_coblocks_responsive_height":"","_coblocks_accordion_ie_support":"","footnotes":"","_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"categories":[32],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-6856","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-cannabis"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.1.1 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>A Quick Guide to Cannabis Edibles in British Columbia - Cannabis Connection - Licensed Cannabis Store<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/cannabis\/a-quick-guide-to-cannabis-edibles-in-british-columbia\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"A Quick Guide to Cannabis 